msgstr ""
"Mattermost Cloud Dedicated에서 발송되는 이메일은 SendGrid를 사용하며, "
"SendGrid 연결은 암호화됩니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/cloud-shared.rst:83
msgid "Audit and observability"
msgstr "감사 및 관측성"

#: ../../source/product-overview/cloud-shared.rst:85
msgid ""
"Mattermost Cloud Dedicated provides access to :doc:`audit and system logs"
